## Legal Firewall

The backend and frontend of FRANKI OS are architecturally separated via
the **Protocolo Esperanto** (JSON over HTTP/HTTPS). No frontend code is
linked into or compiled with the backend.

```
Calling the Protocolo Esperanto API does not make your application a
derivative work of FRANKI OS. You may build client applications that
interface with a licensed FRANKI OS instance without those applications
being subject to this license, provided they do not incorporate source
code from this repository.
```

This separation is intentional and constitutes the architectural boundary
of the Licensed Work.

